---
import GenUiTabs from "../react/GenUiTabs";
---

<section class="relative border-t border-white/8 py-24 md:py-32">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl leading-[1.15] font-medium text-mist-50 md:text-[2.75rem]" data-reveal>
        生成式界面的三种类型
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-5 max-w-[54ch] leading-relaxed text-mist-400" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 60">
        生成式界面不是单选题。治理成本与自由度之间要取一个位置，下面三种类型对应三个不同的位置。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 120">
      <GenUiTabs client:visible />
    </div>

    <figure class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-3xl" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 80">
      <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-ink-850">
        <img
          src="/images/genui-table.webp"
          alt="官方对比表：静态、开放式、声明式三种生成式界面的代表做法、优势与代价"
          width={708}
          height={311}
          loading="lazy"
          decoding="async"
          class="h-auto w-full"
        />
      </div>
      <figcaption class="mt-3 text-center text-xs text-mist-600">
        官方对比：三种生成式界面的取舍各不相同
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>